ate\":null,\"Snippet\":\"administered by defendant Alice Johnson (Johnson).\",\"Title\":\"Estate of Tamico Norton, The v. Avalon Correctional Services, Inc. et al, No. 4:2014cv00106 - Document 26 (N.D. Okla. 2016) :: Justia\",\"Url\":\"https://law.justia.com/cases/federal/district-courts/oklahoma/okndce/4:2014cv00106/36621/26/\"}]},\"Type\":\"ENTITY_SCREENING\"},{\"CreatedAt\":\"2026-09-08T08:32:32.799921Z\",\"Decision\":\"NOT_REVIEWED\",\"Profile\":{\"MatchScore\":0.7,\"MatchTypes\":[\"exact_match\"],\"MatchingName\":\"alice johnson\",\"Person\":{\"Associates\":[],\"DatesOfBirth\":[],\"DatesOfDeath\":[],\"Fields\":[],\"Images\":[],\"Names\":[{\"Name\":\"Alice Johnson\",\"Type\":\"AKA\"}],\"PlacesOfBirth\":[]},\"ProfileIdentifier\":\"068653f3-6707-7475-8000-81db3ec4d7c5\"},\"RiskIdentifier\":\"01a08025-c01f-7209-80bb-8f987a53e90e\",\"RiskIndicators\":{\"AMLTypes\":[\"r_money_laundering.r_predicate_offenses.r_narcotics_psychotropics_trafficking\"],\"Media\":[{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2018-04-27T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Johnson was convicted of drug conspiracy and money laundering charges\",\"Title\":\"Prisoners set free by President Obama urge broader action on clemency - Insider\",\"Url\":\"https://www.insider.com/prisoners-set-free-by-president-obama-urge-broader-action-on-clemency-2016-12?amp\"}]},\"Type\":\"ENTITY_SCREENING\"},{\"CreatedAt\":\"2026-09-08T08:32:32.799914Z\",\"Decision\":\"NOT_REVIEWED\",\"Profile\":{\"MatchScore\":0.7,\"MatchTypes\":[\"exact_match\"],\"MatchingName\":\"alice johnson\",\"Person\":{\"Associates\":[],\"DatesOfBirth\":[],\"DatesOfDeath\":[],\"Fields\":[],\"Images\":[],\"Names\":[{\"Name\":\"Alice C. Johnson\",\"Type\":\"AKA\"},{\"Name\":\"Alice Johnson\",\"Type\":\"AKA\"}],\"PlacesOfBirth\":[]},\"ProfileIdentifier\":\"068653f3-6067-7328-8000-918b1550bb36\"},\"RiskIdentifier\":\"01a08025-c01f-7209-80bb-8f987a53e90d\",\"RiskIndicators\":{\"AMLTypes\":[\"r_money_laundering.r_predicate_offenses.r_forgery\",\"r_regulatory_reputational.r_non_financial_criminality\",\"r_fraud\",\"r_money_laundering.r_predicate_offenses.r_organized_groups_racketeering\"],\"Media\":[{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2023-06-28T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"The murder of Musu, which has gained national attention, has resulted in Scott being charged with criminal conspiracy and for "making false statements to law enforcement officials", along with Gertrude Newton, Alice Johnson, and Rebecca Youdeh Wisner.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Cllr. Gloria Musu Scott, Others Indicted for Murder on ‘Hearsay Evidence’\",\"Url\":\"https://www.liberianobserver.com/liberia-cllr-gloria-musu-scott-others-indicted-murder-hearsay-evidence\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":null,\"Snippet\":\"One of the defendants named Alice Johnson in the murder trial of Charloe Musu involving former Chief Justice Gloria Musu Scott testified that she only had the chance to see the image of the intruder.\",\"Title\":\"Heritage News\",\"Url\":\"http://heritagenewslib.com/heritage/news/news/detail/i-saw-an-image-that-stabbed-me-alice-johnson-testifies-in-charloe-musus-murder-trial-1363\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":null,\"Snippet\":\"Cllr. Scott, who served as Chief Justice of Liberia, Justice Minister and Sentor of Maryland County, Gertrude Newton, Alice Johnson and Rebecca Wisner, are undergoing trial for the crimes of murder, criminal conspiracy and making false statements to law enforcement officers.\",\"Title\":\"Heritage News\",\"Url\":\"http://heritagenewslib.com/public/index.php/heritage/news/news/detail/hold-placed-on-charloe-musus-murder-trial-again-1143\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":null,\"Snippet\":\"He said the ages of the accused, Cllr. Scott, Gertrude Youde, Alice Johnson and Rebecca Newton who were indicted for the crime of murder, criminal conspiracy and making false statements cannot amount to the pressure or force used.\",\"Title\":\"Heritage News\",\"Url\":\"http://heritagenewslib.com/public/index.php/heritage/news/news/detail/in-charloe-musus-murder-case-foreign-pathologist-trashes-liberian-pathologists-report-1388\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":null,\"Snippet\":\"On the outcome of the LNP’s investigation, Cllr. Musu Scott was charged along with other family members. They are Rebecca Youdeh Wisner, Gertrude Newton, and Alice Johnson, with the crimes of murder, conspiracy and making false statements to the law enforcement officers.\",\"Title\":\"Heritage News\",\"Url\":\"http://heritagenewslib.com/heritage/news/news/detail/cso-council-warns-against-politicization-of-charloe-musus-legal-matter-787\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":null,\"Snippet\":\"Former Chief Justice- Cllr. Scott, Gertrude Newton, Rebecca and Alice Johnson are currently ongoing court trial for the crime of murder, criminal conspiracy and making false statements to Police Officers.\",\"Title\":\"Heritage News\",\"Url\":\"http://heritagenewslib.com/public/index.php/heritage/news/news/detail/court-subpoenas-lonestar-orange-to-testify-in-the-late-charloe-musu-murder-trial-1317\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2024-08-19T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"The other family members convicted alongside Scott are Rebecca Youdeh Wisner, Gertrude Newton, and Alice Johnson.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Supreme Court Schedules Appeal Hearing in Murder Case Involving Former Chief Justice Scott - allAfrica.com\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202408190568.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2024-08-19T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"They were found guilty of charges including murder, criminal conspiracy, and making false statements to law enforcement officers.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Supreme Court Schedules Appeal Hearing in Murder Case Involving Former Chief Justice Scott - allAfrica.com\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202408190568.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2024-07-01T07:33:47Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Defense lawyers filed the appeal after a Circuit in Monrovia upheld jurors' guilty verdict against Cllr. Scott and her family members Gertrude Newton, Rebecca Youdeh Wisner, and Alice Johnson for murder.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Supreme Court Hears Cllr. Scott Case\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202407010146.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2024-06-28T14:53:07Z\",\"Snippet\":\"The indictment claimed that on February 22, 2023, at about 10:00 PM, Cllr. Gloria Musu-Scott, Gertrude Newton, Alice Johnson, and Rebecca Youdeh Wisner with criminal intent, armed themselves with a sharp instrument believed to be a knife and pepper spray and willfully, intentionally, purposely, and maliciously inflicted several bodily injuries on Charloe Musu including her chest, right hand, left thigh and left armpit, leading to her death and thereby committing the crime of murder.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia's Supreme Court Ready to Hear Appeal in Former Chief Justice Scott, Relatives' Murder Case\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202406280427.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2024-06-20T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"For the murder, criminal conspiracy, and giving false statements to law enforcement over the death of her niece Charloe Musu in February 2022, Cllr. Scott, Gertrude Newton, Alice Johnson, and Rebecca Youdeh Wisner were all given life sentences in 2023.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Who Saying Truth - allAfrica.com\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202406200674.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2024-06-17T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Cllr. Scott and three of her family members - Gertrude Newton, Alice Johnson, and Rebecca Youdeh Wisner have been serving life imprisonment after jurors handed a guilty verdict against them on 21 December 2023.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Justice Scott Denies Compassion Leave - allAfrica.com\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202406170239.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2024-01-10T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Gloria Maya Musu-Scott, un’importante giurista ed ex politica liberiana, presidente della Corte Suprema della Liberia dal 1997 al 2003, è stata condannata all’ergastolo assieme ad altre tre sue parenti, Gertrude Newton, Alice Johnson e Rebecca Youdeh Wisner.\",\"Title\":\"In Liberia un'ex presidente della Corte Suprema è stata condannata all'ergastolo per l'omicidio della nipote - Il Post\",\"Url\":\"https://www.ilpost.it/2024/01/10/liberia-presidente-corte-suprema-ergastolo/?amp=1\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2023-08-09T09:04:13Z\",\"Snippet\":\"On Wednesday, August 2, 2023, the prosecution filed a motion for a Change of Place/Venue, stating that the named defendants, Cllr. Gloria Musu Scott, Gertrude Newton, Rebecca Youdeh Wisner and Alice Johnson; were arrested, investigated and charged by the Crime Services Department (CSD) of the Liberia National Police(LNP) for the commission of the crimes mentioned.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: State Summersaults Over Change of Venue Plea\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202308090080.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2023-07-07T07:50:57Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Cllr. Scott and her family members Rebecca Youdeh Wilson, Gertrude Newton, and Alice C. Johnson are charged with murder, criminal conspiracy, and [providing] false reports to law enforcement officials.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Mere Political Witch Hunt?\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202307070155.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2023-07-05T08:15:46Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Cllr. Scott and her family members Rebecca Youdeh Wilson, Gertrude Newton, and Alice C. Johnson are charged with murder, criminal conspiracy, and [providing] false reports to law enforcement officials.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Cllr. Scott Considers Appeal to Supreme Court\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202307050106.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2023-06-23T10:05:50Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Well-armed riot police escorted Cllr. Scott, Rebecca Youdeh Wilson, Gertrude Newton, and Alice C. Johnson to the Monrovia Central Prison on charges of murder, criminal conspiracy, and [providing] false reports to law enforcement officials.\",\"Title\":\"Liberia: Cllr. Scott, Family At Maximum Prison\",\"Url\":\"https://allafrica.com/stories/202306230320.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2024-01-10T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Le quattro donne sono accusate di omicidio, associazione a delinquere e falsa testimonianza per l’uccisione di Charloe Musu, nipote di Musu-Scott, di 29 anni, avvenuta il 22 febbraio del 2023.\",\"Title\":\"In Liberia un'ex presidente della Corte Suprema è stata condannata all'ergastolo per l'omicidio della nipote - Il Post\",\"Url\":\"https://www.ilpost.it/2024/01/10/liberia-presidente-corte-suprema-ergastolo/?amp=1\"}]},\"Type\":\"ENTITY_SCREENING\"},{\"CreatedAt\":\"2026-09-08T08:32:32.799897Z\",\"Decision\":\"NOT_REVIEWED\",\"Profile\":{\"MatchScore\":0.7,\"MatchTypes\":[\"exact_match\"],\"MatchingName\":\"alice johnson\",\"Person\":{\"Associates\":[],\"DatesOfBirth\":[],\"DatesOfDeath\":[],\"Fields\":[],\"Images\":[],\"Names\":[{\"Name\":\"Alice Marie Johnson\",\"Type\":\"AKA\"},{\"Name\":\"Alice Johnson\",\"Type\":\"AKA\"}],\"PlacesOfBirth\":[]},\"ProfileIdentifier\":\"066f2a32-8fbf-7125-8000-0eb9893e6d64\"},\"RiskIdentifier\":\"01a08025-c01f-7209-80bb-8f987a53e90c\",\"RiskIndicators\":{\"AMLTypes\":[\"r_money_laundering.r_predicate_offenses.r_narcotics_psychotropics_trafficking\"],\"Media\":[{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2026-07-26T14:37:09Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Alice Marie Johnson, whose draconian life sentence for nonviolent drug offenses was commuted by Trump\",\"Title\":\"Trump says he believes in giving people a 'second chance.' For 6,000 people, the answer was no.\",\"Url\":\"https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/other/trump-says-he-believes-in-giving-people-a-second-chance-for-6-000-people-the-answer-was-no/ar-AA28IifC\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2026-07-26T11:07:25Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Alice Marie Johnson, whose draconian life sentence for nonviolent drug offenses was commuted by Trump\",\"Title\":\"Trump Says He Believes in Giving People a 'Second Chance.' For 6,000 People, the Answer Was No. (opinion)\",\"Url\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/news/politics/articles/trump-says-believes-giving-people-110047151.html\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2026-07-26T11:05:03Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Alice Marie Johnson, whose draconian life sentence for nonviolent drug offenses was commuted by Trump\",\"Title\":\"Trump Says He Believes in Giving People a 'Second Chance.' For 6,000 People, the Answer Was No.\",\"Url\":\"https://reason.com/2026/07/26/trump-says-he-believes-in-giving-people-a-second-chance-for-6000-people-the-answer-was-no/\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2026-02-18T21:16:49Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Johnson had her federal sentence commuted by Trump in 2018 and received a full pardon in 2020 after serving 21 years in prison for her role in a cocaine trafficking organization.\",\"Title\":\"Why Donald Trump pardoned former Buffalo Bills running back\",\"Url\":\"https://eu.uticaod.com/story/sports/football/nfl/bills/2026/02/18/donald-trump-pardons-travis-henry-buffalo-bills/88723850007/\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2026-02-18T12:44:27Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Johnson had her federal sentence commuted by Trump in 2018 and received a full pardon in 2020 after serving 21 years in prison for her role in a cocaine trafficking organization.\",\"Title\":\"Why Donald Trump pardoned former Buffalo Bills running back\",\"Url\":\"https://eu.democratandchronicle.com/story/sports/football/nfl/bills/2026/02/18/donald-trump-pardons-travis-henry-buffalo-bills/88723850007/\"},{\"Identifier\":null,\"PublishingDate\":\"2023-06-27T00:00:00Z\",\"Snippet\":\"Alice Marie Johnson, who had been in prison since October 1996 after being convicted for helping facilitate communications in a drug trafficking case.\",\"Title\":\"Kim Kardashian Recalls Testifying at Murder Trial at 14: 'Insane'\",\"Url\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/kim-kardashian-recalls-testifying-murder-trial-14-tj-jackson-mother-2023-6?r=US\\u0026IR=T\"}]},\"Type\":\"ENTITY_SCREENING\"}]",
